{"type":"message","id":"77330c79","parentId":"57443f9a","timestamp":"2026-05-20T07:51:14.751Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ Image generated, publishing to Google Drive...\n\n<thinking>\nStep 4 — Publish to Google Drive. The feature image validated successfully, so I will preprocess the markdown to embed the image, replace chart placeholders with the actual chart path, convert to DOCX with pandoc, then spawn the publisher agent and wait for the real Drive link. I must not invent the URL.\n</thinking>"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_DxvrDHal5RugSrfChsqUySNj","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"if [ -f /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg ] && [ $(stat -c%s /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg 2>/dev/null || stat -f%z /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg 2>/dev/null || echo 0) -gt 10000 ]; then\n    printf '![Feature Image](/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg)\\n\\n' | cat - /tmp/crypto-article.md > /tmp/crypto-with-image.md\n    echo \"[IMAGE] Embedded valid feature image.\"\nelse\n    cp /tmp/crypto-article.md /tmp/crypto-with-image.md\n    echo \"[IMAGE] No valid feature image found, skipping embedding.\"\nfi\n\npython3 - <<'PYEOF'\nimport os, re\nwith open('/tmp/crypto-with-image.md', 'r') as f:\n    content = f.read()\n\nchart = os.path.realpath('/tmp/chart.png')\nif os.path.exists(chart) and os.path.getsize(chart) > 5000:\n    content = content.replace('[CHART_PLACEHOLDER]', '![Price Chart](/tmp/chart.png)')\n    print(f\"[CHART] Replaced placeholders with chart image reference\")\nelse:\n    content = content.replace('[CHART_PLACEHOLDER]', '')\n    content = re.sub(r'\\n{3,}', '\\n\\n', content)\n    print(\"[CHART] No valid chart — stripped placeholders from DOCX export\")\n\nwith open('/tmp/crypto-with-image.md', 'w') as f:\n    f.write(content)\nPYEOF\n\npandoc /tmp/crypto-with-image.md -o /tmp/crypto-article.docx --standalone","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","