{"type":"message","id":"6ad049d2","parentId":"840eec7c","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:39:03.266Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_UlIkIlyM3BDp3v1k9rIBgJzs","toolName":"memory_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"323ca4090dd3a4e98ce45390d41d023585cda64c88319ba290c2cf3021f63075\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 612,\n      \"endLine\": 701,\n      \"score\": 1,\n      \"textScore\": 0.5346738909287835,\n      \"snippet\": \"- required artifact missing after retry policy exhausted\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 6) Step-by-step execution contract\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Step 0 — Initialize Run\\n\\n### Entry condition\\nUser sends:\\n- “run pipeline”\\n- “run crypto news pipeline”\\n- “start crypto pipeline”\\n\\n### Required actions\\n- generate run id and run dir\\n- create symlinks\\n- initialize manifest\\n- set:\\n  - `status=active`\\n  - `current_step=init`\\n  - `next_step=research`\\n\\n### Exit condition\\nManifest exists and init is marked succeeded.\\n\\n### Next action\\nImmediately start Step 1.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Step 1 — Research\\n\\n### Entry condition\\n- `current_step=research`\\n- `steps.research.status=pending|retrying`\\n\\n### Required actions\\n- clear researcher session file\\n- run research\\n\\nSource: memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md#L612-L701\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md#L612-L701\",\n      \"corpus\": \"memory\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cf5a8f124099a149c88763e41ecc67fee3917add3afd4c60ed202ac4c339a4b0\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 557,\n      \"endLine\": 633,\n      \"score\": 1,\n      \"textScore\": 0.4901086470294874,\n      \"snippet\": \"- if `user_input_required=true`, then `status` must be `awaiting_user_confirmation`\\n- if `approval_required=true`, then `status` must be `blocked_approval`\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 5) Orchestration rules\\n\\n## 5.1 Step completion rule\\nWhen a step finishes successfully:\\n\\n1. validate output\\n2. update manifest\\n3. decide next step\\n4. launch next step immediately in the same execution flow\\n\\n**Do not stop after step success.**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5.2 Progress message rule\\nProgress messages are allowed, but only as a side effect of continued execution.\\n\\n### Valid\\n- send progress update\\n- immediately launch next command\\n- or immediately continue polling a running command\\n\\n### Invalid\\n- send progress update\\n- end turn\\n- nothing i\\n\\nSource: memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md#L557-L633\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md#L557-L633\",\n      \"corpus\": \"memory\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"608e3d1df1c557c34d0cb9d0930ad73eabb6fbd6c6da20892582e7a5ad30a9e0\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 806,\n      \"endLine\": 887,\n      \"score\": 1,\n      \"textScore\": 0.6724881423821296,\n      \"snippet\": \"- `status=awaiting_user_confirmation`\\n  - `current_step=await_wp_confirmation`\\n  - `next_step=publish_wordpress`\\n  - `user_input_required=true`\\n\\n### Required behavior\\nThis is the **only normal interactive pause**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Step 5 — Await WordPress Confirmation\\n\\n### Entry condition\\nDrive publish succeeded.\\n\\n### Required actions\\nSend final pre-publish message with:\\n- article title\\n- real Google Doc URL\\n- feature image path/status\\n- prompt for yes/no\\n\\n### Allowed state\\n- `status=awaiting_user_confirmation`\\n- `user_input_required=true`\\n\\n### Forbidden behavior\\nDo not run any next step until user answers.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Step 6 — WordPress Publish\\n\\n### Entry condition\\nUser explicitly says yes/publish/g\\n\\nSource: memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md#L806-L887\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/2026-05-18-bitcoin-depot.md#L806-L887\",\n      \"corpu