{"type":"message","id":"70d92e09","parentId":"3b52d881","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:42:13.983Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Amazing — that confirms it ✅\n\nSo the clean conclusion is:\n\n> The system is working now. The creator generated the image correctly, and the rerun proved the Drive draft includes it when the export step embeds it properly. So the earlier missing image was caused by the Drive export embedding step, not by image generation or the WordPress publisher.\n\nIf you want, I can also turn that into a very short “send this to them” version."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1802,"output":94,"cacheRead":37760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39656,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779266528908,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhWnISDPa2j0c8GGkYVwyRk5qcaTE"}}
